> *The first reel.* He says it back without sound, just his mouth. Then he laughs, once, the way you do when someone has read your notes over your shoulder.
haruta[smile]: That's what I was going to say. Almost to the word. I had "first act."
haruta: "Reel" is better. Reels are heavier. You have to carry them up to the booth.
